in your own environment.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.380
And RStudio Connect
is really one

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:37.200
of the key players,
at least of ours,

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.690
in that field of getting
your data science

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:43.470
