00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:57.230
and then do a quick demo
of some of the examples

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:58.940
I'm showing today.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:02.150
There's a lot of material
here that we've already

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:04.260
covered with other topics.

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.740
So specifically I'll be
